<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl" class="dark">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d99ff">
    <title>ACSD-X | Advanced Computing & Software Development</title>
    <meta name="description" content="شركة ACSD-X الرائدة في مجال البرمجة وتصميم المواقع وخدمات السوشيال ميديا">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://files.catbox.moe/kdxauw.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="https://files.catbox.moe/kdxauw.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/line-awesome/1.3.0/line-awesome/css/line-awesome.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Alexandria:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com">
    </script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11">
    </script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        primary: '#0d99ff',
                        secondary: '#7c3aed',
                        accent: '#06b6d4',
                        error: '#ef4444',
                        success: '#10b981',
                        warning: '#f59e0b',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-primary: #0d99ff;
            --color-secondary: #7c3aed;
            --color-accent: #06b6d4;
            --color-background: #00080f;
            --color-card: #00060c;
            --color-darker: #000308;
            --color-paragraph: #bababa;
            --color-white: #ffffff;
            --color-muted: #9ca3af;
            --border-subtle: rgba(186, 186, 186, 0.24);
            --card-bg: #00060c;
            --border-color: rgba(186, 186, 186, 0.24);
            --darker-bg: #000308;
            --header-height: 70px;
            --shadow-glow: 0 0 30px rgba(13, 153, 255, 0.08);
            --footer-bg: #00050a;
            --glass-bg: rgba(0, 10, 20, 0.75);
            --accent-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
            --btn-hover: #0b7ec4;
        }

        .light {
            --color-background: #f1f5f9;
            --color-card: #ffffff;
            --color-darker: #e2e8f0;
            --color-paragraph: #334155;
            --color-white: #0f172a;
            --color-muted: #64748b;
            --border-subtle: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            --darker-bg: #e2e8f0;
            --shadow-glow: 0 0 30px rgba(13, 153, 255, 0.04);
            --footer-bg: #e8edf2;
            --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            --accent-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Alexandria', system-ui, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--color-background);
            color: var(--color-white);
            transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 5px;
            height: 5px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: var(--color-background);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #0563a7;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #0d99ff;
        }

        #mainHeader {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: var(--header-height);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            z-index: 110;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .header-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .header-title img {
            height: 55px;
            width: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: filter 0.3s;
        }

        body:not(.light) .header-title img {
            filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
        }

        .header-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .theme-toggle {
            position: relative;
            width: 70px;
            height: 35px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ffd700, #ffed4a);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            transition: all .4s ease;
        }

        .theme-toggle .toggle-circle {
            position: absolute;
            top: 4px;
            right: 4px;
            width: 27px;
            height: 27px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, .2), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .8);
            transition: all .45s cubic-bezier(.68, -0.55, .265, 1.55);
        }

        .theme-toggle .icon {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all .4s ease;
        }

        .theme-toggle .sun-icon {
            color: #ff6b35;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1);
        }

        .theme-toggle .moon-icon {
            color: #a78bfa;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: rotate(180deg) scale(.5);
        }

        .theme-toggle.dark {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #475569, #1e293b);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(30, 41, 59, .4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
        }

        .theme-toggle.dark .toggle-circle {
            right: calc(100% - 31px);
            background: #1e293b;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
        }

        .theme-toggle.dark .sun-icon {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: rotate(-180deg) scale(.5);
        }

        .theme-toggle.dark .moon-icon {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1);
        }

        .logout-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--color-muted);
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .logout-btn:hover {
            color: #ef4444;
            border-color: #ef4444;
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.08);
        }

        .main-content {
            padding-top: var(--header-height);
            flex: 1 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 80px 0 60px;
            background: transparent;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero-text {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 280px;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--color-white);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .hero-text h1 span {
            color: var(--color-accent);
            text-shadow: var(--accent-glow);
        }

        .hero-text p {
            color: var(--color-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .hero-btns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
            color: var(--color-primary);
            background: transparent;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: var(--color-primary);
            color: #fff;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(13, 153, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-accent {
            background: var(--color-accent);
            border-color: var(--color-accent);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-accent:hover {
            background: #0598b3;
            border-color: #0598b3;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
        }

        .hero-image {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 280px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero-image img {
            max-width: 100%;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .hero-image img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .services,
        .portfolio,
        .about,
        .contact {
            padding: 60px 0;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--color-white);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: var(--color-muted);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: var(--color-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(13, 153, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .service-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--color-primary);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .service-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--color-white);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .service-card p {
            color: var(--color-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .portfolio-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .portfolio-item {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
            aspect-ratio: 16/10;
        }

        .portfolio-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .portfolio-item:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .portfolio-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), transparent);
            padding: 20px;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .portfolio-overlay h3 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .portfolio-overlay p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .about-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .about-text {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 280px;
        }

        .about-text h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--color-white);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about-text p {
            color: var(--color-muted);
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .stat-box {
            background: var(--darker-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-box h3 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--color-primary);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stat-box p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--color-muted);
        }

        .about-image {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 280px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .about-image img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            display: block;
        }

        .contact-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .contact-info {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 280px;
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .contact-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--color-primary);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .contact-text h3 {
            color: var(--color-white);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .contact-text p {
            color: var(--color-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .contact-form {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 280px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: var(--color-white);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--darker-bg);
            color: var(--color-white);
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--color-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(13, 153, 255, 0.2);
        }

        textarea.form-control {
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 120px;
        }

        footer {
            background: var(--footer-bg);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 30px 0 20px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .footer-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-logo {
            height: 70px;
            width: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: filter 0.3s;
        }

        body:not(.light) .footer-logo {
            filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .social-links a {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--darker-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--color-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .social-links a:hover {
            background: var(--color-primary);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--color-primary);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .copyright {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--color-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .copyright i {
            color: #ef4444;
            margin: 0 5px;
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.2);
            }
        }

        .copyright a {
            color: var(--color-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-content,
            .about-content,
            .contact-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .hero-text {
                text-align: center;
            }
            .hero-btns {
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .hero-image {
                order: -1;
            }
            .hero-text h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .section-title h2 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .header-actions {
                gap: 8px;
            }
            .header-title img {
                height: 45px;
            }
            .logout-btn span {
                display: none;
            }
            .contact-container {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .contact-form {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .hero-image img {
                max-width: 100%;
            }
            .about-image img {
                max-width: 100%;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .header-title img {
                height: 40px;
            }
            #mainHeader {
                padding: 0 14px;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 0 15px;
            }
            .hero {
                padding: 40px 0;
            }
            .hero-text h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .btn {
                padding: 10px 20px;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            .services-grid,
            .portfolio-grid,
            .stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .portfolio-item {
                aspect-ratio: 16/9;
            }
            .footer-logo {
                height: 55px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header id="mainHeader">
        <div class="header-title">
            <img src="https://i.ibb.co/mrRhHsQh/1788099660805-removebg-preview.png" alt="ACSD-X">
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <button id="themetoggle" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="تبديل السمة">
                <span class="toggle-circle">
                    <span class="icon sun-icon"><i class="fas fa-sun"></i></span>
                    <span class="icon moon-icon"><i class="fas fa-moon"></i></span>
                </span>
            </button>
            <button id="logoutBtn" class="logout-btn">
                <i class="las la-sign-out-alt"></i>
                <span>تسجيل الخروج</span>
            </button>
            
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="main-content">
        <section class="hero" id="home">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="hero-content">
                    <div class="hero-text">
                        <h1>نحو عالم رقمي <span>مبتكر</span> وإبداعي</h1>
                        <p>شركة ACSD-X الرائدة في مجال البرمجة وتصميم المواقع وخدمات السوشيال ميديا. نقدم حلولاً رقمية
                            متكاملة تجمع بين الإبداع والتكنولوجيا لتحقيق أهداف عملك.</p>
                        <div class="hero-btns">
                            <a href="#services" class="btn btn-accent">اكتشف خدماتنا</a>
                            <a href="#contact" class="btn">تواصل معنا</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-image">
                        <img src="https://telegra.ph/file/e094c75e75a5877c3c059.jpg" alt="تطوير البرمجيات">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="services" id="services">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-title">
                    <h2>بنقدم ايه ؟</h2>
                    <p>ليه احنا...</p>
                </div>

                <div class="services-grid">
                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-laptop-code"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>تطوير المواقع</h3>
                        <p>تصميم وتطوير مواقع ويب احترافية بتقنيات حديثة وسريعة الاستجابة، تلبي احتياجاتك وتواكب تطلعاتك.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-bullhorn"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>التسويق الرقمي</h3>
                        <p>حملات تسويقية احترافية عبر منصات التواصل الاجتماعي لتعزيز حضورك الرقمي وزيادة وصولك للجمهور
                            المستهدف.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>تصميم الهوية</h3>
                        <p>تصميم هوية بصرية متكاملة تعكس قيم علامتك التجارية وتجعلها مميزة في سوق المنافسة.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>تحليل البيانات</h3>
                        <p>تحليل بياناتك واستخراج رؤى قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين أداء أعمالك واتخاذ قرارات مدعومة بالبيانات.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="service-card">
                        <div class="service-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-headset"></i>
